{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46201","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十五 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千岩万壑路倾欹，杉桧蒙蒙独掩扉。\n斸药童穿溪𥕕去，采花蜂冒晓烟归\n闲行放意寻流水，静坐支颐到落晖。\n长忆南泉好言语，如斯痴钝者还稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}